cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its archived outputs, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Positive Governance: computational social science companion (SEM, MCMEA, ABM)"
abstract: >-
  Research companion to the doctoral dissertation "Positive Governance".
  It contains structural equation models of World Values Survey Wave 7
  governance perceptions (data not included), MCMEA evolutionary-deduction
  notebooks, and the outcome-blind agent-based model abm_governance
  (Levels 0.1-1.3b) with its archived evidence outputs and manuscript sources.
authors:
