    given-names: Kan
    affiliation: "Graduate School of Public Administration, National Institute of Development Administration (NIDA)"
keywords:
  - governance
  - state capacity
  - institutional constraint
  - structural equation modelling
  - evolutionary computation
  - agent-based modelling
  - computational social science
